@origin = http://localhost:3000
@workspace = REPLACE_WITH_WORKSPACE_UUID
@cookie = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_SESSION
@csrf = REPLACE_WITH_CSRF_TOKEN

# Every active workspace member can use obsidian_write through an interactive bot
# request, for example: "Save Projects/Launch.md with these decisions..."
# These panel API examples require the workspace's deployment operator session.

### The built-in vault is enabled even without saved plugin settings.
GET {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/plugins/obsidian
Cookie: repodesk_session={{cookie}}

### Save against the vaultRevision returned above (initially 0).
POST {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/plugins/obsidian/files
Cookie: repodesk_session={{cookie}}
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"save","revision":0,"path":"Projects/Launch.md","content":"---\ntags: [project/launch]\nstatus: open\n---\n# Launch\n\n[[Home]]\n- [ ] Confirm the owner\n"}

### Search shared notes and open tasks. Follow nextOffset for more results.
GET {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/plugins/obsidian?tag=project&tasks=open&limit=25&offset=0
Cookie: repodesk_session={{cookie}}

### Read source and metadata.
GET {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/plugins/obsidian/file?path=Projects%2FLaunch.md
Cookie: repodesk_session={{cookie}}

### Native daily-note append. Replace revision with the latest vaultRevision.
POST {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/plugins/obsidian/files
Cookie: repodesk_session={{cookie}}
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"daily","revision":1,"date":"2026-10-22","content":"Discussed [[Projects/Launch]]."}

### Export a ZIP snapshot; extract and open the folder as a vault in Obsidian.
GET {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/plugins/obsidian/export
Cookie: repodesk_session={{cookie}}

### Atomic merge import; overwrite requires deliberate opt-in.
POST {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/plugins/obsidian/files
Cookie: repodesk_session={{cookie}}
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"import","revision":2,"overwrite":false,"files":[{"path":"Decisions/Scope.md","content":"# Scope\n\nRelated: [[Projects/Launch]]."}]}

### Disable bot tools without deleting notes. Use the common plugin revision.
PUT {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/plugins/obsidian
Cookie: repodesk_session={{cookie}}
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"revision":0,"enabled":false}
